# Dayanch VIP (`usr_bnjXUy4O1NZufeqW`)

- **No Happ fragmentation** in subscription: no `#fragmentation-*` body lines, no `fragment=` in vless links, no `fragmentation-*` HTTP headers.
- All other clients keep panel default fragmentation (`2,0-1,tlshello`).
- **Subscription pool:** relay lines only — `glb-vps-1` (Tampa) + `relay-eu-*` (5 EU). No 7-node Cloud Run pool.
- When changing Dayanch sub: refresh **only** this user; do not mass-refresh subscriptions.

Implementation: `lib/vip-users.js`, `resolveHappFragmentationForUser()` in `lib/happ-fragmentation.js`.
